  <h1>Enshrouded 1.0 Release: Date, Platforms, Level Cap and Everything New</h1>

  <p class="muted">
    Enshrouded <strong>1.0.0.0 is out now</strong> on <strong>PC (Steam), PlayStation 5</strong>
    (including PS5 Pro) and <strong>NVIDIA GeForce Now</strong>. The full release raises the player
    level cap to <strong>50</strong> and gear to <strong>55</strong>, opens the
    <strong>Cinder's Cradle</strong> biome and closes the current story arc, adds <strong>9 new
    spells</strong>, the <strong>Sparkworks</strong> logic system, and it <strong>resets every skill
    tree</strong>. Existing Early Access saves and bases keep working. Keen Games published the
    complete changelog with the release trailer — the changes that affect how you play are below.
  </p>

